      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 603344092,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Hi,\nI think using the \"standard formula\" is better practice:\n<pre>\n#.FN_BODY S1-Message VAL_PTR = &parameter_tvb\n  tvbuff_t *parameter_tvb;\n  proto_tree *subtree;\n%(DEFAULT_BODY)s\n  if (!parameter_tvb)\n    return offset;\n\n  subtree = proto_item_add_subtree(actx->created_item, ett_s1ap_S1_Message);\n  proto_tree_add_item(subtree , hf_index, parameter_tvb, 0, -1, ENC_UTF_16|ENC_LITTLE_ENDIAN);\n</pre>",
          "author": {
            "id": 6792385,
            "username": "AndersBroman",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "AndersBroman",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
